data: {"answer": "這裡有門禁讀卡機、監視器、訪客登記系統，以及安全室（分機 1100）。\n重點是防止尾隨，刷卡時別讓陌生人跟著進來，訪客也要有人陪同。\n你可以往走廊盡頭走，那裡通往機房入口、酒吧庫存與 ERP、資訊服務台或機房。", "go": [{"key": "billiard", "en": "IT Help Desk", "zh": "資訊服務台", "base_en": "IT Help Desk", "base_zh": "資訊服務台", "url": "https://livetour.istaging.com/6a1e0bab-b805-4788-935b-97a06a024613?index=6", "tour": "A", "why_en": "Next in the story", "why_zh": "故事的下一站"}], "followups": [{"text": "監視器與錄影系統是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the CCTV & Video Management do?", "zh": "監視器與錄影系統是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "尾隨與未經授權進入要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent tailgating & unauthorised entry?", "zh": "尾隨與未經授權進入要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 7.89, "total_s": 7.9}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "corridor", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "corridor"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 6.2}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "corridor", "label": "Room", "en": "Corridor", "zh": "走廊"}, {"key": "cctv", "label": "System", "en": "CCTV & Video Management", "zh": "監視器與錄影系統"}, {"key": "access_control", "label": "System", "en": "Badge Access Control", "zh": "門禁系統"}, {"key": "visitor_mgmt", "label": "System", "en": "Visitor Management", "zh": "訪客登記系統"}, {"key": "tailgating", "label": "Threat", "en": "Tailgating & Unauthorised Entry", "zh": "尾隨與未經授權進入"}, {"key": "physical_access", "label": "Control", "en": "Physical Access Control", "zh": "實體門禁"}, {"key": "cctv_monitoring", "label": "Control", "en": "CCTV Monitoring", "zh": "監視器監控"}, {"key": "password_policy", "label": "Control", "en": "Strong Password Policy", "zh": "密碼政策"}, {"key": "visitor_control", "label": "Control", "en": "Visitor Registration & Escort", "zh": "訪客登記與陪同"}], "edges": [{"a": "cctv", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "access_control", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "visitor_mgmt", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "tailgating", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "access_control"}, {"a": "tailgating", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "password_policy", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "physical_access", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "physical_access", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "access_control"}, {"a": "physical_access", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "tailgating"}, {"a": "cctv_monitoring", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "cctv_monitoring", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "tailgating"}, {"a": "visitor_control", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "visitor_control", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "tailgating"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：員工走廊與實體安全\n這裡講的是：門禁讀卡機、監視器和訪客登記守著員工區；這裡的政策公告是兩道鎖的線索：密語長度和螢幕鎖定的分鐘數開宴會廳的多因素驗證門，資安監控中心的分機也能開往湖心館的員工通道。\n重點：刷卡門不要讓人跟著進來，訪客要有人陪同。\n在這裡的部門：安全室（分機 1100）\n這裡的系統：監視器與錄影系統、門禁系統、訪客登記系統\n這裡要注意的威脅：尾隨與未經授權進入\n看得到的防護措施：實體門禁、監視器監控、密碼政策、訪客登記與陪同\n相關的處理流程：員工證遺失\n可以走到：走廊盡頭・機房入口、酒吧庫存與 ERP、資訊服務台、機房（限制進入）", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 7.89, "load_s": 0.0, "prompt_tokens": 722, "prompt_s": 2.64, "gen_tokens": 76, "gen_s": 5.22, "tok_per_s": 14.6, "first_token_s": 2.67}}, "state": {}}

